WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.210 --> 00:00:01.630
- When Mark and Emily got married

00:00:01.630 --> 00:00:04.600
I helped them invest some
extra money for their future.

00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:06.270
A few years later they wanted kids

00:00:06.270 --> 00:00:08.280
but had to go to a fertility clinic.

00:00:08.280 --> 00:00:12.763
Those investments really
paid off because it worked.

